 is an obvious sign of the righteous judgment of God, to the end that you may be counted worthy of God’s Kingdom, for which you also suffer."},{"verse":6,"text":"For it is a righteous thing with God to repay affliction to those who afflict you,"},{"verse":7,"text":"and to give relief to you who are afflicted with us when the Lord Jesus is revealed from heaven with his mighty angels in flaming fire,"},{"verse":8,"text":"punishing those who don’t know God, and to those who don’t obey the Good News of our Lord Jesus,"},{"verse":9,"text":"who will pay the penalty: eternal destruction from the face of the Lord and from the glory of his might,"},{"verse":10,"text":"when he comes in that day to be glorified in his saints and to be admired among all those who have believed, because our testimony to you was believed."},{"verse":11,"text":"To this end we also pray always for you that our God may count you worthy of your calling, and fulfill every desire of goodness and work of faith with power,"},{"verse":12,"text":"that the name of our Lord Jesus may be glorified in you, and you in him, according to the grace of our God and the Lord Jesus Christ."}],"hasArtwork":true,"artworkUrl":"/data/images/books/2thessalonians.svg","availableLangs":["zh-CN"]},{"id":"2thessalonians_2","bookSlug":"2thessalonians","chapter":2,"reference":"2 Thessalonians 2","title":"2 Thessalonians 2 — Public Domain Study","topics":["2 thessalonians","2thessalonians","nt","scripture","帖撒羅尼迦後書","帖撒罗尼迦后书","不法的人","不法的人"],"snippet":{"zh-CN":"弟兄们，论到我们主耶稣基督降临和我们到他那里聚集，"},"tokens":{"17":2,"53":1,"thessalonians":7,"public":2,"domain":2,"study":1,"2thessalonians":2,"nt":1,"scripture":1,"帖撒羅尼迦後書":1,"帖撒罗尼迦后书":2,"不法的人":2,"弟兄们":2,"论到我们主耶稣基督降临和我们到他那里聚集":1,"我劝你们":1,"无论有灵":1,"有言语":1,"有冒我名的书信":1,"说主的日子现在":1,"到了":3,"不要轻易动心":1,"也不要惊慌":1,"人不拘用什么法子":1,"你们总不要被他诱惑":1,"因为那日子以前":1,"必有离道反教的事":1,"并有那大罪人":1,"就是沉沦之子":1,"显露出来":1,"他是抵挡主":1,"高抬自己":1,"超过一切称为神的和一切受人敬拜的":1,"甚至坐在":1,"神的殿里":1,"自称是":1,"我还在你们那里的时候":1,"曾把这些事告诉你们":1,"你们不记得吗":1,"现在