athering together to him, we ask you"},{"verse":2,"text":"not to be quickly shaken in your mind or troubled, either by spirit or by word or by letter as if from us, saying that the day of Christ has already come."},{"verse":3,"text":"Let no one deceive you in any way. For it will not be unless the rebellion comes first, and the man of sin is revealed, the son of destruction."},{"verse":4,"text":"He opposes and exalts himself against all that is called God or that is worshiped, so that he sits as God in the temple of God, setting himself up as God."},{"verse":5,"text":"Don’t you remember that when I was still with you, I told you these things?"},{"verse":6,"text":"Now you know what is restraining him, to the end that he may be revealed in his own season."},{"verse":7,"text":"For the mystery of lawlessness already works. Only there is one who restrains now, until he is taken out of the way."},{"verse":8,"text":"Then the lawless one will be revealed, whom the Lord will kill with the breath of his mouth and destroy by the manifestation of his coming;"},{"verse":9,"text":"even he whose coming is according to the working of Satan with all power and signs and lying wonders,"},{"verse":10,"text":"and with all deception of wickedness for those who are being lost, because they didn’t receive the love of the truth, that they might be saved."},{"verse":11,"text":"Because of this, God sends them a powerful delusion, that they should believe a lie,"},{"verse":12,"text":"that they all might be judged who didn’t believe the truth, but had pleasure in unrighteousness."},{"verse":13,"text":"But we are bound to always give thanks to God for you, brothers loved by the Lord, because God chose you from the beginning for salvation through sanctification of the Spirit and belief in the truth,"},{"verse":14,"text":"to which he called you through our Good News, for the obtaining of the glory of our Lord Jesus Christ."},{"verse":15,"text":"So then, brothers, stand firm and hold the traditions which you were taught by us, whether by word or by letter."},{"verse":16,"text":"Now our Lord Jesus Christ himself, and God our Father, who loved us and gave us eternal comfort and good hope through grace,"},{"verse":17,"text":"comfort your hearts and establish you in every good work and word."}],"hasArtwork":true,"artworkUrl":"/data/images/books/2thessalonians.svg","availableLangs":["zh-CN"]},{"id":"2thessalonians_3","bookSlug":"2thessalonians","chapter":3,"reference":"2 Thessalonians 3","title":"2 Thessalonians 3 — Public Domain Study","topics":["2 thessalonians","2thessalonians","nt","scripture","帖撒羅尼迦後書","帖撒罗尼迦后书","請為我們禱告","请为我们祷告"],"snippet":{"zh-CN":"弟兄们，我还有话说：请你们为我们祷告，好叫主的道理快快行开，得着荣耀，正如在你们中间一样，"},"tokens":{"18":2,"53":1,"thessalonians":7,"public":2,"domain":2,"study":1,"2thessalonians":2,"nt":1,"scripture":1,"帖撒羅尼迦後書":1,"帖撒罗尼迦后书":2,"請為我們禱告":1,"请为我们祷告":1,"弟兄们":3,"我还有话说":1,"请你们为我们祷告":1,"好叫主的道理快快行开":1,"得着荣耀":1,"正如在你们中间一样":1,"也叫我们脱离无理之恶人的手":1,"因为人不都是有信心":1,"但主是信实的":1,"要坚固你们":1,"保护你们脱离那恶者":1,"我们靠主深信":1,"你们现在是遵行我们所吩咐的":1,"后来也必要遵行":1,"愿主引导你们的心":1,"叫你们爱":1,"并学基督的忍耐":1,"我们奉主耶稣基督的名吩咐你们":1,"凡有弟兄不按规矩而行":1,"不遵守从我们所受的教训":1,"就当远离他":1,"你们自己原知道应当怎样效法我们":1,"因为我们在你们中间":1,"未尝不按规矩而行":1,"也未尝白吃人的饭":1,"倒是辛苦劳碌":1,"昼夜做工":1,"免得叫你们一人受累":1,"这并不是因我们没有权柄":1,"乃是要给你们作榜样":1,"叫你们效法我们":1,"我们在你们那里的时候":1,"曾吩咐你们说":1,"若有人不肯做工":1,"就不可吃饭":1,"因我们听说":1,"在你们中间有人不按规矩而行":1,"什么工都不做":1,"反倒专管闲事":1,"我们靠主耶稣基督吩咐":1,"劝戒这样的人":1,"要安静做工":1,"吃自己的饭":1,"你们行善不可丧志":1,"若有人不听从我们这信上的话":1,"要记下他":1,"不和他交往":1,"叫他自觉羞愧":1,"但不要以他为仇人":1,"要劝他如弟兄":1,"愿赐平安的主随时随事亲自给你们平安":1,"愿主常与你们众人同在":1,"保罗亲笔问你们安":1,"凡我的信都以此为记":1,"我的笔迹就是这样":1,"愿我们主耶稣基督的恩常与你们众人同在":1,"belongs":1,"to":3,"the":8,"book":2,"of":6,"new":2,"testament":2,"spanning":1,"chapters":1,"this":1,"chapter":2,"contains":1,"verses":1,"compiled":1,"locally":1,"from":2,"world":1,"english":1,"bible":1,"web":1,"opening":1,"passage":1,"finally":1,"brothers":1,"pray":1,"for":1,"us":1,"that":1,"word":1,"lord":2,"may":1,"spread":1,"rapidly":1,"and":2,"be":2,"glorified":1,"even":1,"as":1,"als